  "description": {
    "text": "The EX Trainer Kit, released in June 2004 in English, French, German and Italian only, taught the game with two 30-card half decks, Latias and Latios, together with a starter and an intermediate rule book, a playmat, damage and status counters, a coin and an EX booster pack. Each half deck's cards carry the kit's own set symbol and number and no rarity mark.\n\nThe Latios half deck runs on Lightning Energy and holds ten different cards, 1/10 to 10/10, reprinted from EX Ruby & Sapphire, EX Sandstorm and EX Dragon. The exception is the holo Latios, until then a Japanese promotional card."
  },
  "tell": {
    "text": "The Latios half-deck symbol, and a number out of 10"
  },
